WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.208 --> 00:00:02.583
I'm building a space ship.

00:00:02.792 --> 00:00:04.500
Do you really think this is going to fly?

00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:05.333
Yes,

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:06.250
don't you?

00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:07.917
But that would be impossible.

00:00:08.542 --> 00:00:09.417
Aww.

00:00:09.958 --> 00:00:11.500
Only those who try

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:13.375
can achieve the impossible.

00:00:13.542 --> 00:00:16.000
Stillwater!

00:00:18.708 --> 00:00:19.750
Good girl!

00:00:23.625 --> 00:00:24.542
Yeah, woo!

00:00:29.792 --> 00:00:30.875
Ahh!

00:00:31.042 --> 00:00:33.375
It's okay to feel disappointed Carl.

00:00:33.542 --> 00:00:34.250
It is?

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.833
Sometimes we all need a little help.

00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:38.333
We can maybe do it together?

00:00:44.917 --> 00:00:46.667
Would you like to hear a story?

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.625
We all have gifts to share

00:00:49.708 --> 00:00:50.583
but sometimes

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:53.083
we have to look a little closer to find them.

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:54.208
I love your stories.

00:00:54.292 --> 00:00:54.917
Ready...

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:55.625
...set...

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:56.208
...go!

00:00:56.458 --> 00:00:57.417
Woo-hoo!

00:01:04.125 --> 00:01:04.875
Three...

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:05.750
...two...

00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:06.625
...one!

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:07.667
Launch!

00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:11.208
We're moving.

00:01:11.292 --> 00:01:12.417
We're in space now.

00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:13.458
Wow!

00:01:13.667 --> 00:01:15.458
I don't know how you did it Carl.

